  "source": "## Semantics: T4, T3, C3, M0, A1\ngrammar ConformanceByteSequence version \"1.0.0\" mode \"v1\" {\n  ## CRLF, then exactly two ASCII digits.\n  main = %x0D.0A 2*2( %x30-39 )\n\n  entry main: main\n\n  test main {\n    accept \"\\r\\n42\"\n    reject \"\\r42\"\n    reject \"\\n42\"\n    reject \"\\r\\n4\"\n  }\n}\n",
